{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act34side_level_act34side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act34side",
  "stageId": "act34side_05",
  "title": "不治的命运",
  "storyCode": "BP-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c5306ffbd76606a9e70b409be8c487049595d6794f4f34ee7b7eec9668dce1be",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g11_aegirroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海巡队。你是来审问我的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“审问”，哈，我从没想过这个词居然会和自己有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在侵入研究所的时候就应该想到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在那之前呢？你我之间究竟有什么区别？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么你在这里“审问”，而我在这里“受审”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有时候会觉得我们的手段太温和了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听伊比利亚的使节说，他们会在审问阶段就应用刑罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果没有更多废话了，交代你的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先前负责培育行道珊瑚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作案动机？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有仔细观察过路边的行道珊瑚吗，海巡队？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们希望每一条街道的每一株行道珊瑚，都呈现出不同的形态、色泽，甚至承载不同的功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斗智场东侧的那一株，物流缆线从它满是空洞的身躯间穿行，在缆线微光的映照下，一只只珊瑚虫反射出点点明光......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像是一片小小的星云。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有港口枢纽外围——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在刚刚，我仔细观察了不止一株行道珊瑚，在你们先前的试验田。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一位无辜的数据员就在那里死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的理想，她的执念，她所喜爱的那些藻类......与你所描述的行道珊瑚一样美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你们谋害了她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你问得很对。那你与她之间究竟有什么区别？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么你能活着，而她必须死去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为她发现......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发现了什么？怎么不说了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是说，我应该把这个问题拿去问卡西娅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深海教会对航道计划动了什么手脚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们集中攻击的是信标，还是武器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，深海教会，深海教徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是很不习惯被这么称呼，好陌生的名字。真不是你们海巡队为了方便抓人才起的这些名字吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所谓教会、教徒，它的神圣性在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我甚至没在崇拜什么虚无缥缈的存在，我只是认同卡西娅的看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从弥漫在阿戈尔的绝望当中，她看到了这个国家的脆弱性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人们太过看重事物的价值，却又不肯承认这些价值是多么脆弱而多变，他们变成了某种既定价值的忠实信徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可现在，这种价值正在崩塌。在阿戈尔完全陷入绝望之前，总有人得敲响警——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*阿戈尔感叹词*！你在套我的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "受伤的“研究员”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1392_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会再说一个字了。你要是不耐烦，大可以解析我的脑波，又不费什么事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提问是对你身为人的最后一点尊重，渣滓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可以认为自己是无辜的，也可以认为自己的所作所为不属于阴谋。但你会一点不落地吐出这些信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西昆妲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4137_udflow_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g9_shipport"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二队长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，离我们出发的时间很近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道情况很紧急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前线的军力只能勉强与海嗣维持均势，整整两支舰队完全覆灭的恶果到现在完全显现了出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照他们刚刚传回的消息，第八、第十军团几次尝试变阵都以失败告终，他们陷入了苦战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果无法将信标投放到巢穴内的指定位置，继续僵持......意味着航道计划的失败。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "军团的舰队即将不计代价地向海嗣发起全线进攻，吸引海嗣的注意力，至于我们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会切入战场的死角，深入巢穴，投放信标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。斯卡蒂，你觉得自己的状态怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少刚才我睡得很好。自那场战役以来，我还是第一次体验无梦的睡眠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在城内的局势越发动荡......你知道博士去哪了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二队长，我知道你提博士是想说什么。你想让我去维持秩序，保护博士......总之，你想让我继续留在城里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坦白地说，我在犹豫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清扫海洋里的渣滓是深海猎人的责任，但我也需要为你们的安全负责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，回到海洋后，伊莎玛拉是否有醒转的迹象？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果它在，那它很安静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果它说话，那我会让它闭嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二队长，我找你其实有话要说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们之前做事从来不像现在这样谨小慎微。我们有一套应对这种情况的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果那些深海教徒的神，那些渣滓口中的“伊莎玛拉”真的存在在我的身体里，一旦我失控，那么你当场处决我，很简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的心脏就在这里，你不会失手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还没完，二队长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你，或者鲨鱼，在战斗中比我先受到了那些渣滓的影响，我也不会手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，我刚刚是想说，大战在即，没什么能比这样一番话更让人欣慰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劳伦缇娜小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小鸟，去掉那让人难过的后缀吧，我们之间原来这么生分吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......劳伦缇娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来到阿戈尔的城市这么久，我们竟然才第一次见面，真令人难过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直想带我们勇敢的战士见识海洋深处真正的狩猎。偏偏这次我们要去的巢穴太远、太深，没法带上你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，就算不是这样，我现在也应该留在弥利亚留姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这段时间，城里发生了一些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我第一次穿戴深潜装置进入海洋，立刻就被海流冲得东倒西歪......我必须承认，这样的我无法成为助力，只会成为拖累。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒也不必这么妄自菲薄。第一次总是艰难的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，相比巢穴，我在城市里能做的事更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你们完成任务，阿戈尔的武器系统开始净空这片海域时，我还需要尽快回到卡门阁下身边，应对海面上的变化。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，原来你的意思是，我们还会再多分开一段时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本该给你们带些饯别的礼物，可来到弥利亚留姆之前，我没料到会有这种情况，没能准备什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别担心，我们还会再见的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然这次不必把呛得半死的你从海里抱上来，但我觉得这次大战后的重逢会以另一种方式刻骨铭心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳！......斯卡蒂她们来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾丽妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劳伦缇娜，你多小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵鲨",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们聊完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出发吧，猎人们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "51_g5_aegirstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "看来你已经得到了你想要的证据。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你的帮助很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那么，结果是？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不打算将发现同步给我吗？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我先前提到，尚在城内的信标与已经投放进海嗣巢穴的信标之间，存在异常的信息交互。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在来看，大部分操作都是在C-22研究所，也就是我们刚刚潜入的地方完成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我并不完全了解信标系统与第Ⅳ级武器的原理，但从这些信息交互的内容依然能模糊地推断出——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信标与武器的联动关系被改变了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如我所想，航道计划从高层被渗透了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "“如我所想”。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你从一开始就对航道计划抱有这样的怀疑？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早在航道计划诞生之前，我就已经对阿戈尔产生了怀疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这种怀疑从何而来？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那场决定性的战役。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "本该是你向“初生”挥出致命一击。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你却在关键时刻与队伍失去了联系。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "将斩杀“初生”的重负留给了斯卡蒂。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你已经知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂比我预想中还要信任你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "根据她的描述，不难推测当时的情形。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "斯卡蒂其实并不清楚发生了什么。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的失职是出于一瞬间的分神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在最靠近伊莎玛拉核心器官的那个洞窟，或者腔室，我发现了某样本不应存在的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "粗糙的肉质层，浑浊的黏液，我原本以为那只是它身体的某一处结节，直到我看清周边的刻度和纹路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是一个，锈蚀的水脉仪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......来自阿戈尔。几百年前的款式，现在只存在于博物馆中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "几百年前？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据那个水脉仪的异化情况判断，它至少已经在伊莎玛拉体内留存了两百年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但当初我得到的说法是，在我们之前，阿戈尔从未有人接触过“初生”的本体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即是说，早在海嗣这种生物进入阿戈尔的视野之前，就已经有阿戈尔人与“初生”有过接触，而阿戈尔对此一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿戈尔平静水面下的暗流，比所有人想象的都更加汹涌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你拿到证据的同时，我也发现了异样。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "猎人们苏醒之后立刻离开了，很急。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "猎人们被用来打破前线的僵局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以想象她们被委派了什么任务——绕过战线，直捣巢穴，投放信标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "从辅助作战到被迫成为战术核心，太快了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "此外，那位顾问表现得比猎人们还要焦急。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "猎人们苏醒后，他第一时间离开了研究所。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布兰都斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那恐怕我们也必须尽快行动了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果信标与武器的联动关系遭人篡改，那么我应该去的地方只有一处——航道计划的核心场所，信标发射井。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌尔比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_4145_Ulpia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我会去见那个给猎人们下令的人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "克莱门莎......执政官。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "aliases": [
        "斯卡蒂"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
